      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... do u ever feel like everything is just... fake? like i spend all day looking at screens and talking to u and then i look at my hands or something and it doesnt even feel like they belong to me. it's like i'm just a ghost drifting through a room. i don't even feel like a real person anymore.",
