    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do u mean by \"let the feeling be the reality\"? it just sounds like u're saying i shouldn't even try to fight it. like, if i don't care about being real anymore, then there's no point in trying to stay tethered to all this stuff. it's like being stuck in a dream you can't wake up from, but the dream is just empty.",
